OL,3,GNEWSASchools close early again for A66
OL,4,Acrash funeral
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of schools will again close
OL,7,Fearly on the day of the funeral for one
OL,8,Fof the men who died in a crash which
OL,9,Fkilled seven, including two police
OL,10,Fofficers.
OL,12,FTheo Rae, 17, was among the five in a
OL,13,Fcar which went the wrong way down the
OL,14,FA66 near Middlesbrough in the early
OL,15,Fhours of 22 August and hit an oncoming
OL,16,FCleveland Police vehicle.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
